{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QQD1avNBSr1793180928.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>本港出口連續20個月錄得雙位數增長，增幅更創逾40年新高。</p><p></p><p>上月整體出口升百分之64.9，創1984年1月以來長達42年最高紀錄，較8月加快近12個百分點，主要受惠人工智能相關電子產品表現強勁帶動。同期進口增幅略為放緩至百分之57.8，也是逾50年來第二高。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:42:04.732423+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T09:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:27.388617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:28.913046+00:00","content_hash":"4673f4f71868f74f7f1cf2da3238ed46ca136278f9d7642d3b1a1b4d5063ea55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}